- An authenticated session exists (valid `JSESSIONID` for user `john / demo`)
- Two accounts with known IDs are available (provided by seeded dataset)
- Steps to Reproduce — Transfer section use `fromAccountId=13344`, `toAccountId=13566` as confirmed in discovery

