## Workaround

No client-side workaround is effective. The HTML `min` attribute on form inputs provides cosmetic protection but does not prevent direct API calls with negative values. Mitigation requires server-side validation:

1. Reject any `amount` ≤ 0 before executing business logic in all financial endpoints
2. Return HTTP 400 with a structured error response
3. Ensure the validation is applied at the service/domain layer, not only at the controller level, to protect against future endpoint additions

